# The CI comparison gate, watched producing each of its answers

Date: 2026-11-02. Host: macOS, python3 -I. Nothing was measured here -- every
candidate below is a committed result file, or that file with its numbers scaled,
which is exactly what the gate is for: it judges a measurement, it does not take one.

