### `l2-synthetic-qr-only.json` — **unjudged**

Not judged: no committed baseline for DN-ENG41/qr_only/native. Baselines available: DN-ENG41/default/java, DN-ENG41/full/java, DN-ENG41/mixed/java, DN-ENG41/mixed/native. A run of a device, configuration or decoder backend nothing has been baselined on cannot be judged -- take the baseline first, or say in the pull request why this run is not a regression check.

exit 3
```

